text:
 {
  "turns": [
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Thank you for calling Nimbus Telecom. My name is Nisha. How can I help you today?",
      "tags": [
        "greeting"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "Hi Nisha, I'm Vivek Iyer. I've been having terrible network issues at my home on 171 MG Road, and it's getting ridiculous.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "I am sorry to hear that you are experiencing network problems, Mr. Iyer. Before we look into your account, could you please provide your account number?",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "Sure, it is 56165549. My phone number is 95468 71154.",
      "tags": [
        "identity_verification"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Thank you for that information. I can see your account is active. I understand how frustrating it is when your connection is unstable, and I really want to get this sorted for you.",
      "tags": [
        "empathy"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "It's just not working. I've had enough. I want to cancel my service and switch to another provider immediately.",
      "tags": [
        "churn_signal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "I'm sorry to see you go. To proceed with the cancellation, I must inform you that there is an early-termination fee of fifty dollars, and your final bill will arrive within thirty days of the closing date.",
      "tags": [
        "disclosure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "Fifty dollars? You're charging me to leave because your network is broken? This is absolutely outrageous!",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "I understand your frustration. I will raise a network ticket right now to have our engineers investigate the signal strength in your area.",
      "tags": [
        "action:technician_or_ticket"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "I don't care about a ticket! I told you I want to cancel. Just do it now!",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "I can certainly process the cancellation request for you, but since you are requesting a termination due to service failure, I need to escalate this to my supervisor for approval of the fee waiver request.",
      "tags": [
        "action:cancellation_or_retention"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "This is a joke. I've wasted my time and I'm still not getting a resolution. I am beyond dissatisfied with Nimbus Telecom!",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "I apologize for the inconvenience. I have logged the ticket and the escalation to my supervisor. Is there anything else I can help you with today? Thank you for calling, and goodbye.",
      "tags": [
        "closure"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
